It is an adaptation of the Basic Korean Dictionary (한국어기초사전), National Institute of Korean Language, licensed under CC BY-SA 2.0 KR.
Word selection and levels are based on the Korean Language Learning Vocabulary List (한국어 학습용 어휘 목록, 2003),
National Institute of Korean Language, used under KOGL Type 1 (공공누리 제1유형, attribution).
